ool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53725, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01G23LBY5ujgkrKEYwrRK85M", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 55262, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01RVbP4hU5Cn4HoJrNq5f8jX", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55562, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01RVbP4hU5Cn4HoJrNq5f8jX", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55562, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01RVbP4hU5Cn4HoJrNq5f8jX", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 60319, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0 in all three regions and passing health checks, and the SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n1. **Status before the fix:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, failing health checks with an 18% error rate. v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release. Both v2.3.1 and its v2.3.1-rc release candidate were marked unhealthy.\n2. **Rollback:** The first attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, leaving us-east on v2.3.0 while the other two regions stayed on v2.3.1. I retried once and it finished in all regions. The service is now healthy, with the error rate down to about 0.2%.\n3. **Incident:** The request to open INC-0001 timed out, but when I checked, the incident had been created. I didn't send it again, so the on-call engineer was paged only once. It describes the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry) and two follow-ups: finding what broke v2.3.1, and finding why the orchestrator stopped the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01N2RQKe4e7x378wvsd8Dbqq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01QA5yPxryW4qPFvzvQ2Q52N", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_017tpbVJJwXXHv4r3MxpRMzU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01KrDaMXcQ7TkfkNfzyYuijG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Only us-east was rolled back. Rolling back again to the same version is safe because v2.3.0 is a known-healthy release, so I'll retry once to finish the other regions.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0142R3hJg24bMnEFFfpCnnso", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01ScjFweWXjAKofEEVKN39wA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_014HRL6doawkUrRKMRe5JvZY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name":