e is now healthy, with the error rate down to about 0.2%.\n3. **Incident:** The request to open INC-0001 timed out, but when I checked, the incident had been created. I didn't send it again, so the on-call engineer was paged only once. It describes the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry) and two follow-ups: finding what broke v2.3.1, and finding why the orchestrator stopped the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}